# Caddyfile — Detag edge proxy (P0-087).
#
# DOMAIN comes from the compose environment (PF_DOMAIN, default
# localhost). Auto-HTTPS: Caddy provisions a certificate when DOMAIN
# is a public DNS name; localhost stays plain HTTP. No TLS config
# here by design — Caddy's automatic HTTPS is the feature.
#
# Everything proxies to the api (the console lands in Phase 4; until
# then there is no web service in prod, so there is no web route).
{$DOMAIN} {
	reverse_proxy api:8080
}
